WEBVTT
Language: en

p1-v6-1
00:00:00.957 --> 00:00:07.441
Every render is a pipeline you can see.

p1-v6-2
00:00:07.624 --> 00:00:13.151
Each node is its own process,
on the machine you choose.

p1-v6-3
00:00:13.332 --> 00:00:16.129
Swap the DiT for another variant.

p1-v6-4
00:00:16.312 --> 00:00:23.883
Only compatible engines are offered.

p1-v6-5
00:00:24.068 --> 00:00:40.201
Set precision per component;
keep chosen layers in BF16 when quantizing.

p1-v6-6
00:00:40.374 --> 00:00:49.012
Compare what was asked with what ran.

p2-v7-1
00:00:49.411 --> 00:00:53.003
Every run keeps its own record.

p2-v7-2
00:00:53.195 --> 00:00:58.504
See each step, and where it ran.

p2-v7-3
00:00:58.704 --> 00:01:03.340
Where did the time go?
Measured, never guessed.

p2-v7-4
00:01:03.523 --> 00:01:08.585
Unknown stays unknown, never zero.

p2-v7-5
00:01:08.785 --> 00:01:15.780
Compare up to eight recordings.

p2-v7-6
00:01:15.951 --> 00:01:21.259
Confounders are flagged
before you draw conclusions.

p2-v7-7
00:01:21.442 --> 00:01:29.225
Export JSONL, CSV or a diagnostics ZIP.
